<form autocomplete="off">
    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Send Crew to Combat Initiative, not Vehicle</label>
        <input type="checkbox" name="vehicleCombatCrewMode" {{checked vehicleCombatCrewMode}}>
        <p class="notes">When selected, the crew members will be generated or matched and placed in the initiative, but not the ship.</p>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Combat Order Display</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
            <select name="vehicleCombatDisplayMode">
                {{#each displayModes}}
                <option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>
                {{/each}}
            </select>
        </div>
        <p class="notes">Full shows vessel and crew portraits plus Vessel / Crew names. Simple shows the crew portrait with a ship badge.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Ship Badge Icon</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
            <input type="text" name="vehicleCombatShipIcon" value="{{vehicleCombatShipIcon}}">
            <button type="button" data-action="browse-ship-icon" title="Browse image files">
                <i class="fas fa-folder-open"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Enable Vehicle Operations</label>
        <input type="checkbox" name="vehicleOpsEnabled" {{checked vehicleOpsEnabled}}>
        <p class="notes">Enable Full Speed Ahead's Apply Damage, Fuel Scooping, Mining Damage, Scans, Repair Ship, Heat Sink, and cargo failure tools.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Players Can Open Vehicle Operations</label>
        <input type="checkbox" name="vehicleOpsPlayersCanOpen" {{checked vehicleOpsPlayersCanOpen}}>
        <p class="notes">Allow non-GM users to open the vehicle operations window. Mutations still execute through the GM.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Show FSA Floating Menu to Players</label>
        <input type="checkbox" name="vehicleOpsShowFloatingMenuPlayers" {{checked vehicleOpsShowFloatingMenuPlayers}}>
        <p class="notes">Show the draggable FSA floating operations menu to non-GM users. GMs always see the FSA menu while Vehicle Operations are enabled.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Enable Vehicle Operation Scans</label>
        <input type="checkbox" name="vehicleOpsScansEnabled" {{checked vehicleOpsScansEnabled}}>
        <p class="notes">Allow Tactical, Manifest, and Wake scans from the vehicle operations window.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Fallback Repair Cost Per Module HP</label>
        <input type="number" name="vehicleOpsRepairCostPerHp" value="{{vehicleOpsRepairCostPerHp}}" min="0" step="1">
        <p class="notes">Used when TradeHub is unavailable or does not expose a repair HP cost.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Fallback Repair Cost Per Shield HP</label>
        <input type="number" name="vehicleOpsRepairCostPerShieldPoint" value="{{vehicleOpsRepairCostPerShieldPoint}}" min="0" step="1">
        <p class="notes">Used when TradeHub is unavailable or does not expose a shield repair HP cost.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Use TokenMagic Damage Bursts</label>
        <input type="checkbox" name="vehicleOpsTokenMagicDamage" {{checked vehicleOpsTokenMagicDamage}}>
        <p class="notes">If TokenMagic FX is installed, show splash damage filters when vehicle modules take damage.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Use Item Piles for Cargo Jettison</label>
        <input type="checkbox" name="vehicleOpsItemPilesJettison" {{checked vehicleOpsItemPilesJettison}}>
        <p class="notes">If Item Piles is installed, create cargo piles near the vehicle when Cargo Bay failure jettisons cargo.</p>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Automatically Manage Vehicle Shields</label>
        <input type="checkbox" name="vehicleShieldAutomation" {{checked vehicleShieldAutomation}}>
        <p class="notes">Use Shield Generator equipment HP and Morphogenetic Field equipment to turn vehicle protection visuals on or off. Morphogenetic Field is treated as a purple shield. Supports Shield Generator [A], [B], [C], [D], and [Prismatic].</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Vehicle Protection Visual Mode</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
            <select name="vehicleProtectionVisualMode">
                {{#each protectionVisualModes}}
                <option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>
                {{/each}}
            </select>
        </div>
        <p class="notes">Built-In FSA Glow draws a soft pulsating outline from the token silhouette without TokenMagic. TokenMagic FX uses compatible TokenMagic glow filters when that module is installed.</p>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Debug Logging</label>
        <input type="checkbox" name="vehicleCombatDebug" {{checked vehicleCombatDebug}}>
    </div>

    <footer class="sheet-footer flexrow">
        <button type="submit">
            <i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save
        </button>
    </footer>
</form>
